.TH M3UTOLOCAL 1 "August 2026" "m3utolocal 1.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
m3utolocal \- search M3U playlists and download VOD files
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B m3utolocal
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.br
.B m3utolocal
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.I QUERY
.br
.B m3utolocal
.B cleanup
[\fI--apply\fR] [\fI--migrate-cwd\fR] [\fI-o DIR\fR]
.br
.B m3utolocal
.B init
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B m3utolocal
searches an M3U playlist for entries matching
.I QUERY
against
.B tvg-id
or
.B tvg-name
and downloads static video files.
Live streams and
.B .m3u8
URLs are skipped.
.PP
With no arguments, a full-screen Textual TUI is started.
With
.B \-y
,
downloads run headless without interactive selection.
Finished files are written under an output root (XDG data library by default),
never the current working directory.
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I QUERY
Search string for tvg-id or tvg-name (optional when launching the TUI).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-m ", " \-\-m3u " \fIFILE\fR"
Path to the M3U playlist (default from config or
.IR chans.m3u ).
.TP
.BR \-o ", " \-\-output " \fIDIR\fR"
Output directory for downloads (default:
.IR $XDG_DATA_HOME/m3utolocal/library ).
.TP
.BR \-t ", " \-\-threads " \fIN\fR"
Number of simultaneous downloads (default: 1).
.TP
.BR \-r ", " \-\-retries " \fIN\fR"
Retries for failed downloads (default: 1).
.TP
.BR \-y ", " \-\-yes
Headless mode: download all matches without prompts.
.TP
.BR \-L ", " \-\-lang " \fICODE\fR"
UI language code (for example
.BR en ,
.BR es ).
.TP
.B \-\-tui
Force the full-screen Textual interface.
.TP
.B \-\-auto\-clean
Remove classified junk under the output root before downloading.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show help and exit.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B cleanup
Plan or apply removal of stale
.BR .part
files, zero-byte files, and orphan temps under the output root.
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-apply
Delete planned items (default is dry-run).
.TP
.B \-\-parts\-only
Only consider
.B .part
files.
.TP
.B \-\-migrate\-cwd
Move media files from the current directory into the output root.
.RE
.TP
.B init
Write a default JSON config under
.IR $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/m3utolocal/config.json .
.SH FILES
.TP
.I $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/m3utolocal/config.json
User configuration.
.TP
.I $XDG_DATA_HOME/m3utolocal/library/
Default download library.
.TP
.I /usr/local/etc/cloudbsd/m3utolocal/config.json
System-wide defaults (optional).
.TP
.I *.part
In-progress download sidecars under the output root.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B LANG ", " LC_ALL ", " LC_MESSAGES
Locale used when no
.B \-\-lang
or config language is set.
.TP
.B XDG_CONFIG_HOME ", " XDG_DATA_HOME ", " XDG_CACHE_HOME
Base directories for config, library, and cache.
.TP
.B M3UTOLOCAL_LANG ", " M3UTOLOCAL_OUTPUT_DIR ", " M3UTOLOCAL_M3U
Optional environment overrides.
.TP
.B NO_COLOR
Disable colorized CLI progress where applicable.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success.
.TP
.B 1
Usage error, missing files, or hard failure.
.TP
.B 2
Partial download failure.
.TP
.B 130
Interrupted by the user.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
Open the TUI:
.B m3utolocal
.TP
Headless download:
.B m3utolocal \-y \-m /path/playlist.m3u \-o ~/videos "Title"
.TP
Preview cleanup:
.B m3utolocal cleanup \-\-dry\-run
.TP
Spanish UI:
.B m3utolocal \-\-lang es
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR python (1)
